parent who is running on empty? Gifts are coming soon: you’ll be able to send them the Kid Brain Toolkit or the 30-Day Reset, with a card by email on the day you pick.</p>\n      <form class=\"inline-form\" data-form=\"gift\" id=\"gift-form\">\n        <select name=\"gift_item\" id=\"g-item\" aria-label=\"Gift\"><option value=\"program\" selected>The 30-Day Reset · $39</option><option value=\"guide\">The Kid Brain Toolkit · $9</option></select>\n        <div class=\"row2\"><input name=\"from\" id=\"g-from\" placeholder=\"Your name\" aria-label=\"Your name\" required maxlength=\"40\"><input name=\"to\" id=\"g-to\" placeholder=\"Their name\" aria-label=\"Their name\" required maxlength=\"40\"></div>\n        <input type=\"email\" name=\"to_email\" placeholder=\"Their email\" aria-label=\"Their email\" required>\n        <textarea name=\"message\" id=\"g-msg\" rows=\"2\" maxlength=\"140\" placeholder=\"A short message (optional)\" aria-label=\"Message\"></textarea>\n        <label class=\"gdate\">Send it on <input type=\"date\" name=\"send_on\" id=\"g-date\" required></label>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-main\" type=\"submit\" disabled>Gifts: coming soon</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gcard\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"gcard-top\" id=\"g-chars\"></div>\n      <small>A GIFT FOR</small>\n      <div class=\"to\" id=\"g-to-out\">Your friend</div>\n      <div class=\"msg\" id=\"g-msg-out\"></div>\n      <span class=\"gwhat\" id=\"g-item-out\"></span>\n      <div class=\"from\">from <span id=\"g-from-out\">you</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-foot\" id=\"site-foot\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Little Brain Crew home\"><img class=\"logo-img\" src=\"/assets/brand/lbc-logo-horizontal-white.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"48\"></a>\n      <p style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:340px\">The crew inside your kid’s brain, made simple. <a href=\"mailto:hello@littlebraincrew.com\" style=\"color:#fff\">hello@littlebraincrew.com</a></p>\n      <a href=\"/support\" class=\"support-link\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">♥</span> Support the crew · soon</a>\n    </div>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/#plans\">Plans</a><a href=\"/pricing\">The 30-Day Reset</a><a href=\"/pricing#club\">Crew Club</a><a href=\"/ask\">Ask the crew</a><a href=\"/free\">Free tips &amp; stickers</a><a href=\"/gift\">Give it as a gift</a><a href=\"/shop\">Shop</a><a href=\"/schools\">For schools</a><a href=\"/founding\">Founding parents</a><a href=\"/affiliate\">Affiliate program</a><a href=\"/faq\">Parent FAQ</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a><a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a></nav>\n    <div class=\"foot-cols\">\n      <nav aria-label=\"Learn about the crew\">\n        <h2>Learn</h2>\n        <a href=\"/crew\">Meet the crew</a>\n        <a href=\"/brain-chemicals\">Brain chemicals</a>\n        <a href=\"/brain-parts\">Brain parts</a>\n        <a href=\"/habits\">Habits</a>\n        <a href=\"/ages\">Ages</a>\n        <a href=\"/glossary\">Glossary</a>\n      </nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Answers for parents\">\n        <h2>Answers</h2>\n        <a href=\"/why\">Why does my kid…</a>\n        <a href=\"/what-to-say\">What to say</a>\n        <a href=\"/myths\">Myths</a>\n        <a href=\"/guides\">Guides</a>\n        <a href=\"/learn\">All guides</a>\n      </nav>\n      <nav aria-label=\"About Little Brain Crew\">\n        <h2>About</h2>\n        <a href=\"/about\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"/editorial-policy\">How we write</a>\n        <a href=\"/sources\">Sources</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/littlebraincrew/\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@little.brain.crew\" rel=\"me noopener\" target=\"_blank\">TikTok</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"foot-note\">For learning only. Not medical advice. We don’t sell supplements, hormones,